  "notes": [
    "\ud83d\udd27 <b>Higgsfield fix</b> \u2014 AI Video (Timelapse & O1 Edit) works again. Higgsfield changed their servers and every request was being blocked; just click Connect once to sign back in.",
    "\ud83c\udf05 <b>Timelapse</b> \u2014 the shadow timelapse now holds a constant colour temperature \u2014 no more yellow/golden shift at the end.",
    "\ud83d\udcf8 <b>Quick Still</b> \u2014 new button. Grab the frame at the playhead into the project's assets folder, with an optional LUT (Slog3 preselected). Files auto-number 1, 2, 3\u2026 and it works on .aep clips too.",
    "\ud83c\udfb5 <b>Download Audio</b> \u2014 added a Paste button (and a clipboard fallback when Cmd+V doesn't register); tracks now save into the project's assets folder.",
